മൂന്ന് slot bounded composition family-ൽ one-based rank-ന്റെ lexicographic member കണ്ടെത്തുന്ന clean Stage 1 പരിശോധന.

Hamlet, total സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, lower bound സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, upper bound സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, ശേഷിക്കുന്ന one-based rank സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, ആദ്യ part x സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, x കഴിഞ്ഞ ശേഷിക്കുന്ന total സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, രണ്ടാം part-ന്റെ താഴത്തെ പരിധി സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, രണ്ടാം part-ന്റെ മുകളിലെ പരിധി സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Portia, suffix block count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Viola, താൽക്കാലിക പരിധി സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Miranda, തിരഞ്ഞെടുത്ത രണ്ടാം part സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ariel, തിരഞ്ഞെടുത്ത മൂന്നാം part സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, input-output സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: x ഉയരുന്ന ക്രമത്തിൽ suffix pair block-ുകൾ കുറച്ച് rank തുറക്കുന്നു.

Scene I: total, lo, hi, rank വായിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: x=lo.
[Enter Juliet and Macbeth]
Juliet:
 You are as good as myself.

Scene III: x>hi ആണെങ്കിൽ invalid-rank diagnostic.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 Are you better than Romeo?
 If so, let us proceed to scene XIV.

Scene IV: rem=total-x.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and Macbeth.

Scene V: lower=max(lo,rem-hi).
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Viola]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Lady Macbeth and Romeo.
 Are you better than Juliet?
 If so, let us proceed to scene VI.
 Let us proceed to scene VII.

Scene VI: lower=rem-hi.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Viola and Ophelia]
Viola:
 You are as good as myself.
 Let us proceed to scene VIII.

Scene VII: lower=lo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Juliet and Ophelia]
Juliet:
 You are as good as myself.

Scene VIII: upper=min(hi,rem-lo).
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Viola]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Lady Macbeth and Juliet.
 Are you worse than Romeo?
 If so, let us proceed to scene IX.
 Let us proceed to scene X.

Scene IX: upper=rem-lo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Viola and Cordelia]
Viola:
 You are as good as myself.
 Let us proceed to scene XI.

Scene X: upper=hi.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Cordelia]
Romeo:
 You are as good as myself.

Scene XI: block count കണക്കാക്കുന്നു; ശൂന്യമെങ്കിൽ അടുത്ത x.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 Are you better than Cordelia?
 If so, let us proceed to scene XIII.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Portia]
Cordelia:
 You are as good as the difference between myself and Ophelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero:
 Are you better than Portia?
 If so, let us proceed to scene XII.
 Let us proceed to scene XV.

Scene XII: rank ഈ block കഴിഞ്ഞതാണ്; block കുറച്ച് x കൂട്ടുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Portia and Othello]
Portia:
 You are as good as the difference between Othello and myself.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene III.

Scene XIII: suffix block ശൂന്യം; x കൂട്ടുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene III.

Scene XIV: invalid rank-യ്ക്ക് 0,0,0.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are nothing.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Miranda]
Prospero:
 You are nothing.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ariel]
Prospero:
 You are nothing.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene XV: ഈ block-ിൽ second=lower+rank-1, third=rem-second.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Miranda]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of Ophelia and Othello.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ariel]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Lady Macbeth and Miranda.

Scene XVI: x, second, third പുറത്തിടുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Miranda]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ariel]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
